{"id":"vod_sn_38678","vodId":"38678","provider":"sn","providerName":"索尼资源","type":2,"name":"M3 黑色之钢","name_cn":"M3 黑色之钢","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"已完结","images":{"common":"https://snzypic.vip/upload/vod/20230911-1/f83cd7062326a97a9ca632265f5dd5cd.jpg"},"summary":"《M3~黑钢~》是由佐藤顺一担任监督、冈田麿里负责剧本、河森正治执掌机械设计的原创电视动画。于2014年4月21日开始播出。本作是以近未来的东京为舞台的SF系作品，主角是8位少年少女。无限扭曲、浓重的黑色。“无明领域”——人们这样称呼那个黑暗会吞没一切，夺走一切的地方。还有那些如同人类的绝望与混沌的象征般的异形。他们被称为——“惩戒”(imashime）为了调查侵蚀人类精神的“无明领域”，8个少年少女为了对抗“惩戒”被召集起来。在危机之中，现在与过去的命运复杂地交错着，他们可以在无明领域中找到光明吗？","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2023-09-11 16:03:40","playable":true,"episodeCount":24,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"snm3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/vWYtu1yTnS1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1w8TdnH7HZ1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/5V21XUv6Jm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/UwL6f5mVc01/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/3qHkuiRuzT1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/1MgnUTPHz31/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/4rpqraqYjm1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/iGRij8Jy6G1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/dWhpVcFmhk1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/g5GDLbz3GH1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/v1JkM9wSqn1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/Tv2TqSpLie1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/uR6UyF0qSC1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/202309/09/cWZrYqjvqK1/video/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15集","url":"https://v6.rstu6.com/